// Flattened black_dragon.rs2's [ai_queue3,black_dragon] table.
// npc_param(death_drop) resolves to dragon_bones; dragonhide_black is a
// separate unconditional obj_add - both are real guaranteed drops.
// ~trail_hardcluedrop is a tertiary clue-scroll roll, excluded (separate
// NPC-agnostic system). Slots 122-127 (6/128) match no branch: no
// additional drop.
